{"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.08,"text":"Hey, everybody and welcome back to Lingoni."},{"start":3.08,"end":7.2,"text":"My name is Jenny. And today, I want to teach you how to say"},{"start":7.2,"end":11,"text":"That makes sense in German. This is one of those phrases"},{"start":11,"end":13.68,"text":"That we use all the time in everyday"},{"start":13.68,"end":15.12,"text":"Conversations."},{"start":15.12,"end":17.52,"text":"But there isn't just one way to say it."},{"start":17.52,"end":19.48,"text":"There are casual options,"},{"start":19.48,"end":20.84,"text":"Formal options,"},{"start":20.84,"end":23.08,"text":"And there's even one way"},{"start":23.08,"end":25.4,"text":"That's technically wrong,"},{"start":25.4,"end":27.64,"text":"But we use it all the time anyway."},{"start":27.64,"end":30.02,"text":"Let's take a closer look."},{"start":36.24,"end":39,"text":"The standard way to say this would be"},{"start":39,"end":40.64,"text":"Das ergibt Sinn."},{"start":40.64,"end":43.56,"text":"Das ergibt Sinn."},{"start":43.56,"end":44.48,"text":"Oder"},{"start":44.48,"end":46.76,"text":"Das leuchtet mir ein."},{"start":46.76,"end":48.04,"text":"Das leuchtet"},{"start":48.04,"end":49.74,"text":"Mir ein."},{"start":50.2,"end":52.46,"text":"Das ist nachvollziehbar."},{"start":52.88,"end":54.6,"text":"That's understandable."},{"start":54.6,"end":56.78,"text":"Das ist nachvollziehbar."},{"start":57.12,"end":58.88,"text":"Das klingt logisch."},{"start":58.88,"end":60.86,"text":"That sounds logical."},{"start":60.88,"end":63.3,"text":"Das klingt logisch."},{"start":63.4,"end":66.56,"text":"Jetzt verstehe ich das. Now I understand"},{"start":66.56,"end":67.52,"text":"That."},{"start":67.52,"end":69.92,"text":"Jetzt verstehe ich das."},{"start":69.92,"end":72.2,"text":"Das ist schlüssig."},{"start":72.2,"end":73.88,"text":"That's coherent."},{"start":73.88,"end":74.8,"text":"Das"},{"start":74.8,"end":76.24,"text":"Ist schlüssig."},{"start":76.24,"end":79.8,"text":"Actually, in spoken language, a lot of people say"},{"start":79.8,"end":82.4,"text":"Das macht Sinn."},{"start":82.4,"end":85.04,"text":"But this is actually just the literal"},{"start":85.04,"end":86.16,"text":"Translation"},{"start":86.16,"end":87.52,"text":"From English."},{"start":87.52,"end":90.16,"text":"So, it came from the English language."},{"start":90.16,"end":93.96,"text":"Originally, the correct way is das ergibt"},{"start":93.96,"end":95.46,"text":"Sinn."},{"start":96.12,"end":98.72,"text":"But you will hear Germans say das macht Sinn"},{"start":98.72,"end":99.92,"text":"All the time."},{"start":99.92,"end":101.84,"text":"I even say it myself sometimes."},{"start":101.84,"end":104.12,"text":"Hat das Sinn ergeben?"},{"start":104.12,"end":106.16,"text":"Ist das nachvollziehbar,"},{"start":106.16,"end":109.06,"text":"Was ich euch heute erklärt habe?"},{"start":109.08,"end":111.32,"text":"Leuchtet euch das ein?"},{"start":111.32,"end":114.16,"text":"If you want to practice what I taught you today,"},{"start":114.16,"end":116.84,"text":"You can find this lesson along with a worksheet"},{"start":116.84,"end":118.16,"text":"And exercises"},{"start":118.16,"end":121.14,"text":"In the A2 level of our"},{"start":126.96,"end":129.26,"text":"Bis zum nächsten Mal, tschüss."}],"auto":true}